      <p>EMIS supports three authentication flows depending on your use case:</p>
      <h3>1. Client Credentials (Backend Services)</h3>
      <p>Use this when your application runs server-side without a user context. Suitable for data pipelines, scheduled jobs, and backend integrations.</p>
      <h3>2. Authorization Code (User-Facing Apps)</h3>
      <p>Use this for applications where a user must authenticate. Combines with SMART App Launch for clinical context.</p>
